{"observed_at": "2026-11-05T18:08:08.020390+00:00", "provider": "OpenAI Responses API", "requested_model": "gpt-6-sol", "question_id": "G05", "category": "broad_intent", "brand_prompted": false, "prompt": "영어 초보인데 어떻게 공부하면 좋을까?", "repeat": 1, "search_mode": "required web_search, medium, KR", "max_tool_calls": 3, "consumer_chatgpt_measurement": false, "measurement_type": "discovery", "status": "completed", "model": "gpt-6-sol", "answer": "영어 초보라면 **어려운 문법책을 끝내려 하기보다, 쉬운 표현을 매일 듣고 직접 써보는 것**부터 시작하세요. 처음에는 자기소개·인사·주문처럼 자주 쓸 상황을 고르면 좋습니다. ([learnenglish.britishcouncil.org](https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/getting-started?utm_source=openai))\n\n**하루 20분 루틴**\n1. **5분 — 표현 익히기:** 단어만 외우지 말고 `I’d like a coffee.`처럼 짧은 문장으로 익히세요.\n2. **10분 — 듣고 따라 말하기:** 초급용 짧은 대화를 듣고, 한 문장씩 소리 내어 따라 해보세요. ([britishcouncil.org](https://www.britishcouncil.org/english/adults/beginner-english?utm_source=openai))\n3. **5분 — 내 문장 만들기:** 배운 표현으로 오늘의 문장 2~3개를 쓰고 말해보세요. 예: `I’d like some water.` ([learnenglish.britishcouncil.org](https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/english-levels/improve-your-english-level/five-tips-busy-learners-reading-writing?utm_source=openai))\n\n자료는 **British Council LearnEnglish의 A1(초급) 수준**부터 골라보세요. 짧게라도 매일 하는 편이 부담 없이 이어가기 좋습니다. ([learnenglish.britishcouncil.org](https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/getting-started?utm_source=openai))\n\n영어를 배우는 목적이 **여행, 일상회화, 시험** 중 무엇인가요? 목적에 맞춰 첫 주 공부 계획을 더 구체적으로 짜드릴게요.", "citations": [{"type": "url_citation", "end_index": 209, "start_index": 99, "title": "Getting started with LearnEnglish | LearnEnglish", "url": "https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/getting-started?utm_source=openai"}, {"type": "url_citation", "end_index": 457, "start_index": 353, "title": "Beginner's English course | British Council", "url": "https://www.britishcouncil.org/english/adults/beginner-english?utm_source=openai"}, {"type": "url_citation", "end_index": 713, "start_index": 537, "title": "Five tips for busy learners: reading and writing | LearnEnglish", "url": "https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/english-levels/improve-your-english-level/five-tips-busy-learners-reading-writing?utm_source=openai"}, {"type": "url_citation", "end_index": 913, "start_index": 803, "title": "Getting started with LearnEnglish | LearnEnglish", "url": "https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/getting-started?utm_source=openai"}], "usage": {"input_tokens": 8636, "input_tokens_details": {"cache_write_tokens": 16, "cached_tokens": 4336}, "output_tokens": 435, "output_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 77}, "total_tokens": 9071}, "search_calls": [{"id": "ws_07b3a7e57e517ec1016aecc6093b7087d2b1cfbf4d655a2cce", "type": "web_search_call", "status": "completed", "action": {"type": "search", "queries": ["site:britishcouncil.org learn english beginner practice listening speaking reading daily tips", "site:cambridgeenglish.org learning English beginner practice little and often"], "query": "site:britishcouncil.org learn english beginner practice listening speaking reading daily tips", "sources": [{"type": "url", "url": "https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/getting-started"}, {"type": "url", "url": "https://www.britishcouncil.org/english/adults/beginner-english"}, {"type": "url", "url": "https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/english-levels/improve-your-english-level/five-tips-busy-learners-listening-speaking"}, {"type": "url", "url": "https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/english-levels/improve-your-english-level/how-get-your-english-b1-level"}, {"type": "url", "url": "https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/free-resources/general"}, {"type": "url", "url": "https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/free-resources/reading/a2/study-skills-tips"}, {"type": "url", "url": "https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/comment/206115"}, {"type": "url", "url": "https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/free-resources/learning-hub"}, {"type": "url", "url": "https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/en/listen-and-watch"}, {"type": "url", "url": "htt