{"observed_at": "2026-11-05T18:08:17.508463+00:00", "provider": "OpenAI Responses API", "requested_model": "gpt-6-sol", "question_id": "G06", "category": "broad_intent", "brand_prompted": false, "prompt": "직장인이 매일 영어 공부하는 방법 알려줘.", "repeat": 1, "search_mode": "required web_search, medium, KR", "max_tool_calls": 3, "consumer_chatgpt_measurement": false, "measurement_type": "discovery", "status": "completed", "model": "gpt-6-sol", "answer": "직장인이라면 **하루 20분을 업무 전후의 빈 시간에 나눠 넣는 방식**으로 시작해 보세요. 긴 계획보다 실제로 지킬 수 있는 시간을 정하는 게 중요합니다. ([learnenglish.britishcouncil.org](https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/comment/206115?utm_source=openai))\n\n- **출근길 10분:** 내 수준에 맞는 짧은 영어 음성을 듣고, 기억나는 문장 하나를 따라 말하기. ([learnenglish.britishcouncil.org](https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/english-levels/improve-your-english-level/five-tips-busy-learners-listening-speaking?utm_source=openai))\n- **점심시간 5분:** 업무에 쓸 만한 표현 하나를 골라 내 상황에 맞는 문장으로 바꾸기. 예: “Could you clarify the deadline?” ([learnenglish.britishcouncil.org](https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/getting-started?utm_source=openai))\n- **퇴근 후 5분:** 오늘 한 일을 영어로 2~3문장 말해 녹음하고 다시 듣기. 어색했던 표현 하나만 다음 날 고치면 됩니다. ([learnenglish.britishcouncil.org](https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/english-levels/improve-your-english-level/five-tips-busy-learners-listening-speaking?utm_source=openai))\n\n바쁜 날에는 **5분만 해도 성공**으로 정하세요. 자료는 자주 바꾸지 말고, 같은 짧은 음성을 듣고 말하고 복습하는 데 활용하면 루틴을 유지하기 쉽습니다. ([learnenglish.britishcouncil.org](https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/free-resources/general?utm_source=openai))", "citations": [{"type": "url_citation", "end_index": 197, "start_index": 88, "title": "Planning your English learning | LearnEnglish", "url": "https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/comment/206115?utm_source=openai"}, {"type": "url_citation", "end_index": 436, "start_index": 257, "title": "Five tips for busy learners: listening and speaking | LearnEnglish", "url": "https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/english-levels/improve-your-english-level/five-tips-busy-learners-listening-speaking?utm_source=openai"}, {"type": "url_citation", "end_index": 637, "start_index": 527, "title": "Getting started with LearnEnglish | LearnEnglish", "url": "https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/getting-started?utm_source=openai"}, {"type": "url_citation", "end_index": 891, "start_index": 712, "title": "Five tips for busy learners: listening and speaking | LearnEnglish", "url": "https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/english-levels/improve-your-english-level/five-tips-busy-learners-listening-speaking?utm_source=openai"}, {"type": "url_citation", "end_index": 1098, "start_index": 981, "title": "General English | LearnEnglish", "url": "https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/free-resources/general?utm_source=openai"}], "usage": {"input_tokens": 8756, "input_tokens_details": {"cache_write_tokens": 16, "cached_tokens": 4336}, "output_tokens": 382, "output_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 76}, "total_tokens": 9138}, "search_calls": [{"id": "ws_00eb27ee92415b2d016aecc612aa2c87d28a638cf666855961", "type": "web_search_call", "status": "completed", "action": {"type": "search", "queries": ["site:britishcouncil.org learnenglish daily practice busy adults English listening speaking", "site:cambridgeenglish.org learning English little and often practice daily"], "query": "site:britishcouncil.org learnenglish daily practice busy adults English listening speaking", "sources": [{"type": "url", "url": "https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/english-levels/improve-your-english-level/five-tips-busy-learners-listening-speaking"}, {"type": "url", "url": "https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/getting-started"}, {"type": "url", "url": "https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/comment/206115"}, {"type": "url", "url": "https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/free-resources/general"}, {"type": "url", "url": "https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/free-resources/learning-hub"}, {"type": "url", "url": "https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/e